Subject: [PATCH] Routes 47 and 48 and Cliff Cave in line with the land around
 Cianwood

side_wild.py and surf_wild.py had left these out as post-game areas, but
Cliff Edge Gate opens off Cianwood, which a player reaches by surfing
before Chuck, and Route 47's trainers are Lv. 22-29. By the same rule they
follow Chuck: Route 48 and Cliff Cave walking (were 23-29 and 21-26) and
Route 47 surfing (was 10-29) move into his band. Route 47's walking levels
and the Cliff Edge Gate's water are already above it and stay. Generated
by tools/hack/cianwood_wild.py.
